(text "Recovery: Rockchip documents shorting D0 to GND during power-on, then releasing after MaskROM USB enumeration; misuse can damage IO.\nReserve these pads for controlled service recovery. USB recovery connector and normal boot/recovery controls are captured separately.\nAll data/CMD pull-ups are populated for defined reset behavior; maximum static pull-up load is 1.8mA with all ten nets LOW." (at 15.24 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a355cef-5d0c-5bf1-99d9-093a11ee425b"))
)
